":{"text":"📣📣 STOCK SPLIT ALERT\n\nPlease note, there has been a stock split on the following stocks:\n\n● Rush Enterprises Inc - $RUSHA\nThe ratio for the split is 3 for 2\n\n● Rush Enterprises Inc - $RUSHB.US\nThe ratio for the split is 3 for 2\n\n\n👉 What is a stock split?\n\nA stock split is a corporate action in which a company increases the number of its outstanding shares by issuing additional shares to existing shareholders according to a specified ratio. While the number of shares increases, the share price is adjusted proportionally, so the overall value of your holdings remains unchanged.\n\n👉 How do we respond to a stock split?\n\nOur policy in response to a stock split is to adjust the opening rate of the positions in question and increase the number of units held according to the split ratio. This ensures that all subsequent profit calculations remain proportionately correct.\n\nPlease be aware that any changes to the share price and the number of units held are due to this adjustment. 🔊\n\nTo sum it up, the price of the assets and the number of units on the positions may change, but the value of all relevant positions remains the same.\n\nThank you,\n\nThe eToroTeam","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-01T05:22:08.06Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Default","metadata":{},"attachments":[{"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/29470802-33b6-4ace-a60e-c626bf03df84-2026-09-01.png","host":"openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com","mediaType":"Image","media":{"image":{"width":1200,"height":628,"url":"https://openbook-static-files-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/rich-media/images/etoroteam/29470802-33b6-4ace-a60e-c626bf03df84-2026-09-01.png"},"video":{"videoSource":"None","image":{"width":0,"height":0}}}}],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"9756","symbolName":"RUSHA","displayName":"Rush Enterprises Inc","updated":"2026-09-01T05:09:16.193Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":9756,"avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostat